  "title": "Beyond Promotions: How to Grow Without Changing Titles",
  "summary": "For many professionals, career growth has traditionally been measured by one thing: the next title. • Assistant Property Manager becomes Property Manager. • Property Manager becomes Regional Manager. • Maintenance Technician becomes Maintenance Supervisor. • Leasing Consultant becomes Leasing Manager. Promotions matter. They recognize hard work, expanded responsibilities, and the value someone brings to an organization. But they are not the only way to grow.In today’s fast-moving workplace",
